{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36254","headline":"赠美人四首 三 · 方干","name":"赠美人四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒蕴天然自性灵，人间有艺总关情。\n剥葱十指转筹疾，舞柳细腰随拍轻。\n常恐胸前春雪释，惟愁座上庆云生。\n若教梅尉无仙骨，争得仙娥驻玉京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}